outh-eastern Turkey). This article attempts to reconstruct the vicissitudes of this library and to trace at least some books still existing in libraries, like the Medicea Laurenziana Library in Florence.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
